Package: anatomogramdata
Title: Tidy Human Anatomogram Polygon Data from the EBI Expression Atlas Source
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Peter", "Tanksley", email = "peter_tanksley@txstate.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides tidy, ontology-tagged, ggplot2-ready human anatomogram
    polygon data (hgMale/hgFemale), parsed directly from the EBI Expression
    Atlas anatomogram SVG source (Apache-2.0 code / CC-BY-4.0 images). This
    is a data package, not a plotting package -- plot the bundled data with
    ggplot2::geom_map(), which already provides full aesthetic flexibility
    (see examples/).
    An updated, independent reimplementation of the gganatogram package
    (Maag 2018, <doi:10.12688/f1000research.16409.2>), whose idea, approach
    and dataset names it follows; no gganatogram code or data is reused.
    The code was written almost entirely by Claude (Anthropic).
